 'uri': 'nyt://article/90b2033c-34e4-592e-b73d-3082057912aa'}, {'abstract': 'After June’s vote to quit the European Union, hundreds of Britons working in the bloc’s institutions face a new reality as British influence and their prospects recede.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/02/world/europe/britain-brexit-eu-workers-brussels.html', 'snippet': 'After June’s vote to quit the European Union, hundreds of Britons working in the bloc’s institutions face a new reality as British influence and their prospects recede.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — A bereavement. A horrific accident. An emotional spasm. For once, the language coming from the glass and concrete buildings in Brussels is laden not with the dull acronyms of European Union jargon, but with angst.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/01/world/02brussels-web/02brussels-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/01/world/02brussels-web/02brussels-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/01/world/02brussels-web/02brussels-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/01/world/02brussels-web/02brussels-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/01/world/02brussels-web/02brussels-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image