article/69d15486-4932-568a-9334-aeac382433e5', 'word_count': 520, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69d15486-4932-568a-9334-aeac382433e5'}, {'abstract': 'The star of “Holiday Inn: The New Irving Berlin Musical” tries out the season’s best coats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/04/fashion/mens-style/winter-overcoats-jackets-bryce-pinkham.html', 'snippet': 'The star of “Holiday Inn: The New Irving Berlin Musical” tries out the season’s best coats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The slow approach of frosty weather has given an extension to anyone who has yet to pick out a stylish winter coat, and the New York actor Bryce Pinkham is here to help. Now singing and dancing across the stage of Studio 54 as the star of “Holiday Inn: The New Irving Berlin Musical,” a festive show based on the 1942 movie that gave the world “White Christmas,” the Tony-nominated star tries out the season’s standout overcoats and winter jackets.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bundling Up in Style with Broadway’s Bryce Pinkham', 'kicker': 'Dress Codes', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bundling Up in Style', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coats and Jackets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pinkham, Bryce', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berlin, Irving', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-01T16:09:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Men’s Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Tudela', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tudela', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dadb3b49-050d-5a3d-bbbf-027521c09bb0', 'word_count': 80, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dadb3b49-050d-5a3d-bbbf-027521c09bb0'}, {'abstract': "On Saturday afternoons, well-heeled art collectors and smartly-dressed culture seekers take their post-brunch stroll through the galleries of Chelsea. Here's what they wore.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/04/fashion/mens-style/what-9-gallery-hoppers-wore-on-their-chelsea-crawl.html', 'snippet': "On Saturday afternoons, well-heeled art collectors and smartly-dressed culture seekers take their post-brunch stroll through the galleries of Chelsea. Here's what they wore.", 'lead_paragraph': 'Like the first day of school and the return of black-tie galas, the Chelsea gallery crawl ushers in a new season in New York. On Saturday afternoons, well-heeled art collectors and smartly dressed culture seekers take their post-brunch strolls through blue-chip galleries like Hauser & Wirth, Gagosian and David Zwirner. Save the deal making for the workweek; Saturdays are for looking, at the art on the walls and the fashion on the streets. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/fashion/mens-style/04LAAR1/04LAAR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/04/fashion/mens-style/04LAAR1/04LAAR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/fashion/mens-style/04LAAR1/04LAAR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/fashion/mens-style/04LAAR1/04LAAR1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name