ackRock, the world’s largest investment firm, in 2013, was accused by British authorities of trading two stocks using inside information.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/03/business/dealbook/blackrock-fund-manager-insider-trading.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Lyttleton, who left BlackRock, the world’s largest investment firm, in 2013, was accused by British authorities of trading two stocks using inside information.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A former fund manager at BlackRock pleaded guilty to insider trading charges in a London court on Wednesday, the British authorities said.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Former BlackRock Fund Manager Pleads Guilty to Insider Trading', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ex-BlackRock Trader Enters a Plea of Guilty', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Insider Trading', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bray, Chad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Financial Conduct Authority (Great Britain)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BlackRock Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lyttleton, Mark', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-02T13:19:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ae75711-39a3-5f05-ba73-8b988b0836b2', 'word_count': 380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ae75711-39a3-5f05-ba73-8b988b0836b2'}, {'abstract': 'Need help sorting through TV’s endless array of shows and platforms? Here are seven new ones you should check out and where you can watch them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/02/arts/television/7-fall-shows-you-should-be-watching-and-how-to-catch-up.html', 'snippet': 'Need help sorting through TV’s endless array of shows and platforms? Here are seven new ones you should check out and where you can watch them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TENS of thousands of movies, thousands of TV shows, hundreds of channels, dozens of streaming services. There are more movies and series to watch than ever before and more ways to experience them. It can all be a little overwhelming. But we’re here to help. The New York Times recently debuted a website called Watching, designed to help you decide what to watch. British period pieces, Scandinavian crime dramas, sci-fi adventures, oddball dark comedies — tell us what you’re in the mood for, and we’ll help you find your next favorite show or movie.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28WATCHING1/28WATCHING1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28WATCHING1/28WATCHING1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28WATCHING1/28WATCHING1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28WATCHING1/28WATCHING1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28WATCHING1/28WAT