e leader of the Soviet party, Leonid I. Breznev, attacks Communist China and praises Josef Stalin in Tbilisi, Georgia, in November 1966.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Soviet party leader Leonid I. Breznev today attacked Communist China and praised Stalin, a hero of China’s current cultural revolution, as an Old Bolshevik who played an important role in the 1917 revolution. Soviet history books never have denied Stalin’s revolutionary role. But since the de-Stalinization campaign began in 1956, it has been extremely rare for any Kremlin leader to give unqualified public praise to the late dictator. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/blogs/02oldiht-1966-breznev/02oldiht-1966-breznev-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 519, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/blogs/02oldiht-1966-breznev/02oldiht-1966-breznev-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 519, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/blogs/02oldiht-1966-breznev/02oldiht-1966-breznev-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/02/blogs/02oldiht-1966-breznev/02oldiht-1966-breznev-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/blogs/02oldiht-1966-breznev/02oldiht-1966-breznev-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1966: Josef Stalin Makes a Comeback in Russia', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kic