-leaning voters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/03/upshot/what-to-look-for-when-the-polling-drought-ends.html', 'snippet': 'Keep an eye on Donald Trump’s vote share: A key is whether he can consolidate Republican-leaning voters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There have been surprisingly few election polls since the F.B.I. director James Comey’s letter to Congress last week. The dearth of polls has actually been a pattern all year: The number of live-interview polls in the battleground states fell to 36 from 80 compared with a similar period in 2012, according to FiveThirtyEight’s Harry Enten.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/upshot/03UP-POlls/03UP-POlls-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 196, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/03/upshot/03UP-POlls/03UP-POlls-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 196}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/upshot/03UP-POlls/03UP-POlls-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 334, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/upshot/03UP-POlls/03UP-POlls-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/upshot/03UP-POlls/03UP-POlls-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/03/upshot/03UP-POlls/03UP-POlls-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/201