e on now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Obama administration’s Syria policy has collapsed under the weight of a brutal assault on Aleppo by the forces of President Bashar al-Assad and Russia. Shrugging off global condemnation, Russia and Mr. Assad have dispatched their aircraft to attack schools and hospitals, singling out civilian targets to make the city uninhabitable and force its remaining population to flee.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'You Don’t Need a No-Fly Zone to Pressure Russia in Syria', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The upper hand in Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-02T15:39:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Heydemann', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heydemann', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f8bd966-f922-541d-bc42-b74d34e5140b', 'word_count': 931, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2f8bd966-f922-541d-bc42-b74d34e5140b'}, {'abstract': 'The president’s next appearances are planned in the battleground states of North Carolina and Florida, in what’s being called “the last big campaign swing of his political career.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/03/us/politics/obama-hillary-clinton-donald-trump.html', 'snippet': 'The president’s next appearances are planned in the battleground states of North Carolina and Florida, in what’s being called “the last big campaign swing of his political career.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHAPEL HILL, N.C. — With Democrats concerned about lagging e