road range of styles, and its centerpiece marathon, on Jan. 6 and 7.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The NYC Winter Jazzfest has announced its 2017 edition, which will take place Jan. 5 through Jan. 10, with about 140 groups drawing on a range of styles across 13 different stages. As always, the centerpiece will be a smorgasbord-like Winter Jazzfest Marathon, on Jan. 6 and Jan. 7.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/arts/03winterjazz-item/03winterjazz-item-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/03/arts/03winterjazz-item/03winterjazz-item-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/arts/03winterjazz-item/03winterjazz-item-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/arts/03winterjazz-item/03winterjazz-item-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/03/arts/03winterjazz-item/03winterjazz-item-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/arts/03winterjazz-item/03winterjazz-item-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/arts/03winterjazz-item/03winterjazz-item-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo',