04a30c5', 'word_count': 830, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4aa0b9ec-421b-551a-9c47-e894d04a30c5'}, {'abstract': 'A small subset of the electorate who supported Mr. Obama’s call to change in 2008 and 2012 now hear that message in the Republican nominee.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/03/us/politics/obama-donald-trump-voting.html', 'snippet': 'A small subset of the electorate who supported Mr. Obama’s call to change in 2008 and 2012 now hear that message in the Republican nominee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GRANTVILLE, Pa. — It didn’t take long for Jack Morris to regret voting for President Obama. A few months after Mr. Morris, a lifelong Republican, cast his first vote for a Democrat in 2008, he learned that the carpet company where he worked planned to lay off 36 people in Pennsylvania and move his job to Maryland.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/us/03obamatrump1/03obamatrump1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/03/us/03obamatrump1/03obamatrump1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/us/03obamatrump1/03obamatrump1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/us/03obamatrump1/03obamatrump1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/03/us/03obamatrump1/03obamatrump1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/us/03obamatrump1/03obamatrump1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/03/us/03obamatrump1/03obamatrump1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Some Who Saw Change in Obama Find It Now in Donald Trump', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Some Voters Attracted to Obama’s Call for Change Find It Now in Trump', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alcindor, Yamiche', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-02T21:39:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Yamiche Alcindor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Yamiche', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alcindor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6ba8ff46-ceb5-559e-aad2-2c0574ab7de8', 'word_count': 1255, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6ba8ff46-ceb5-559e-aad2-2c0574ab7de8'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Parker was 15 when she was drawn to a newspaper photo of a boy at an arts college; later, his play would draw her to New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/06/theater/mary-louise-parker-the-first-time-i-performed-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Parker was 15 when she was drawn to a newspaper photo of a boy at an arts college; later, his play would draw her to New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was 15. My dad brought me the newspaper, open to an article about an arts college. A whole department was devoted to what I secretly wanted to pursue, drama, but I was drawn to a photo of a boy. He was close to my age, with unruly blond hair, and looking like a badass while riding a unicycle and juggling. When I showed up for my first day of college two years later, seeing this boy in the flesh was like spotting a superhero in a cafeteria, eating cereal. There he is, I thought. Peter Hedges. That dreamy newspaper boy who juggles.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 285, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 285}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 486, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 973, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER/06FIRSTTIME-PARKER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mary-Louise Parker: The First Time I Performed in New York (With Actual Egg on My Face)', 'kicker': 'The First Time', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '… I Had Actual Egg on My Face', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mantello, Joe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hedges, Peter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-02T21:43:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary-Louise Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary-louise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a7f462a6-a1e1-5786-8150-399a8c321002', 'word_count': 983, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a7f462a6-a1e1-5786-8150-399a8c321002'}, {'abstract': 'Tim Wu’s new book, subtitled “The Epic Scramble to Get Inside Our Heads,” examines the history of mass media and marketing, not least on the internet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/03/books/review-attention-merchants-tim-wu.html', 'snippet': 'Tim Wu’s new book, subtitled “The Epic Scramble to Get Inside Our Heads,” examines the history of mass media and marketing, not least on the internet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Does anyone remember when Rolling Rock beer ran a campaign on highway billboards back in 2008,