s-for-public-universities.html', 'snippet': 'State schools like Alabama are following a new survival strategy: lure top students, boost reputation, raise tuition, go big.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s only fitting that the admissions tour for the University of Alabama starts in Bryant-Denny Stadium. On game days, the campus’s iconic quad — a painterly expanse of lawn, majestic trees and bell tower — becomes a crimson and white tent city of numbered tailgating plots, some with electricity.', 'print_section': 'ED', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/education/06PUBLIC-GIF/06PUBLIC-GIF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/06/education/06PUBLIC-GIF/06PUBLIC-GIF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/education/06PUBLIC-GIF/06PUBLIC-GIF-thumbLarge.gif', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/education/06PUBLIC-GIF/06PUBLIC-GIF-articleLarge.gif', 'height': 629, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/06/education/06PUBLIC-GIF/06PUBLIC-GIF-articleLarge.gif', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 629}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/education/06PUBLIC-GIF/06PUBLIC-GIF-jumbo.gif', 'height': 1024, 'width': 978, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/education/06PUBLIC-GIF/0