924d-2e690a041517'}, {'abstract': 'The Republican candidate and the deceased Venezuelan president are both populists by posture, if not ideology.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/04/opinion/is-donald-trump-an-american-hugo-chavez.html', 'snippet': 'The Republican candidate and the deceased Venezuelan president are both populists by posture, if not ideology.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MEXICO CITY — To dramatic music, the video starts with a clip of the Republican nominee for president, Donald J. Trump, threatening to jail his rival, Hillary Clinton, before the words “Te recuerda a alguien” (“Does this remind you of someone”) pop up. The image switches to the former Venezuelan president Hugo Chávez, founder of the self-declared Socialist revolution, who steered his oil-rich nation to meltdown.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/opinion/04GRILLO-inyt/04GRILLO-inyt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 283, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/04/opinion/04GRILLO-inyt/04GRILLO-inyt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 283}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/opinion/04GRILLO-inyt/04GRILLO-inyt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 484, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/opinion/04GRILLO-inyt/04GRILLO-inyt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 967, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/opinion/04GRILLO-inyt/04GRILLO-inyt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumb