-new-york-inmate-judge-rules.html', 'snippet': 'A judge said Leonard Strickland was subjected to excessive force and faulty medical care at the Clinton Correctional Facility, but there was no evidence that a beating directly caused his death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Officers at the Clinton Correctional Facility used excessive force when they dragged a handcuffed inmate face down through prison corridors and then, when he was near death, provided faulty medical care, a judge in a New York State Court of Claims has ruled.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/nyregion/04STRICKLAND1/04STRICKLAND1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/04/nyregion/04STRICKLAND1/04STRICKLAND1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/nyregion/04STRICKLAND1/04STRICKLAND1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/nyregion/04STRICKLAND1/04STRICKLAND1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/04/nyregion/04STRICKLAND1/04STRICKLAND1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/04/nyregion/04STRICKLAND1/04STRICKLAND1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'imag