er ever helped you think differently about yourself and your abilities?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/04/learning/has-a-teacher-ever-changed-your-mind-set.html', 'snippet': 'Has a teacher ever helped you think differently about yourself and your abilities?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometimes we develop ideas about ourselves as a student that are at best, unhelpful, and at worst, destructive. For example, we may think we’re just not good at a subject, like math. Or we may assume, no matter how hard we try, that we’ll fail anyway. Some studies show that teachers can have a lasting impact on students’ academic futures by changing their mind-sets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kirp/30kirp-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kirp/30kirp-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kirp/30kirp-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kirp/30kirp-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 248, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kirp/30kirp-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 248}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kirp/30kirp-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJu