d some creative differences on set. Ahead of “Bad Santa 2,” an oral history of the original.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/06/movies/how-the-first-bad-santa-boozed-down-the-chimney.html', 'snippet': 'The making of the holiday perennial took many cooks and some creative differences on set. Ahead of “Bad Santa 2,” an oral history of the original.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Bob Weinstein first received the script for “Bad Santa,” he felt that a gift had been dropped in his lap. Universal had set the project aside, and Mr. Weinstein snapped it up for his company at the time, Miramax: “I asked a Universal executive, ‘Why’d you guys pass on it?’ And he said, ‘It was the most foul, disgusting, misogynistic, anti-Christmas, anti-children thing we could imagine.’” Mr. Weinstein recalled. “That’s exactly why I bought it.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06BADSANTA1/06BADSANTA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06BADSANTA1/06BADSANTA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06BADSANTA1/06BADSANTA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06BADSANTA1/06BADSANTA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/arts/06BADSANTA1/06BADSANTA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail