he hotel, which he’s updated in his inimitable cheeky and cheery fashion. Given the town’s increasing popularity, travelers have no shortage of hotel options, so he sought to make this one “the perfect fantasy of what a Palm Springs house should be.”', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '36', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/t-magazine/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/13/t-magazine/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/t-magazine/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/t-magazine/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/t-magazine/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/13/t-magazine/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/t-magazine/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0/13tmag-12look_banana-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'heig