ks for the ballet and stage some of his existing pieces, including “No Man’s Land.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/05/arts/dance/liam-scarlett-named-to-queensland-ballet-post.html', 'snippet': 'Li Cunxin, the artistic director of the Australian company, said Mr. Scarlett would create new works for the ballet and stage some of his existing pieces, including “No Man’s Land.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The British choreographer Liam Scarlett, an important name in the ballet world, will become an artistic associate of the Queensland Ballet in 2017. The appointment, announced on Friday by Li Cunxin, the artistic director of the Australian company, follows the ballet’s work with Mr. Scarlett in April on his production of “A Midsummer Night’s Dream.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/05/arts/05scarlett-item/05scarlett-item-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/05/arts/05scarlett-item/05scarlett-item-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/05/arts/05scarlett-item/05scarlett-item-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/05/arts/05scarlett-item/05scarlett-item-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/05/arts/05scarlett-item/05scarlett-item-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11