nitiatives in two counties has drawn more money than the Senate race and votes on marijuana and gun control — combined.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/07/upshot/a-bay-area-soda-tax-fight-is-drawing-big-bucks.html', 'snippet': 'Spending on ballot initiatives in two counties has drawn more money than the Senate race and votes on marijuana and gun control — combined.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this most contentious of elections, you wouldn’t think that a soda tax would be the issue to attract the big bucks. But measures in just two California cities have drawn more money than that state’s Senate race and statewide referendums on marijuana legalization and gun control — combined.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/05/upshot/05UP-Soda/05UP-Soda-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/05/upshot/05UP-Soda/05UP-Soda-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/05/upshot/05UP-Soda/05UP-Soda-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/05/upshot/05UP-Soda/05UP-Soda-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/05/upshot/05UP-Soda/05UP-Soda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/05/upshot/05UP-Soda/05UP-Soda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai