the day for Monday, November 7, 2016.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/07/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Monday, November 7, 2016.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Based on our review, we have not changed our conclusion that we expressed in July with respect to Secretary Clinton.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-11-07T02:08:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/259057dd-086c-5bb8-a64b-2f21cd04e8e0', 'word_count': 41, 'uri': 'nyt://article/259057dd-086c-5bb8-a64b-2f21cd04e8e0'}, {'abstract': 'Angry at Mr. Trump and energized by Democratic outreach efforts, Latinos are turning out in droves, and could be the difference in the outcome in highly contested states.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/07/us/fear-of-donald-trump-helps-democrats-mobilize-hispanics.html', 'snippet': 'Angry at Mr. Trump and energized by Democratic outreach efforts, Latinos are turning out in droves, and could be the difference in the outcome in highly contested states.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald J. Trump maligned undocumented immigrants as murderers and rapists. Hillary Clinton hired a woman who had lived undocumented for many years as her national director of Latino outreach.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/07/us/07FLORIDALATINOS2/07FLORIDALATINOS2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStan