e}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9af2ba2b-9c82-51fa-8ab8-03752e51f33d', 'word_count': 948, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9af2ba2b-9c82-51fa-8ab8-03752e51f33d'}, {'abstract': 'This new roasting pan features a lid that can be flipped and used as a baking dish.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/09/dining/thanksgiving-roasting-pan-turkey.html', 'snippet': 'This new roasting pan features a lid that can be flipped and used as a baking dish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My childhood memories of Thanksgiving always include an oval, speckled-blue enamel roasting pan. That’s what my mother used. Now there’s a new pan for new memories, a nine-quart beauty in heavy triple-ply stainless steel. The lid has no knob or handle on top, so it can be flipped and used alone on top of the stove, on an induction cooker, in the oven as a casserole or baking dish, or even as a sleek serving dish. The roaster comes with a rack: Viking 3-Ply 3-in-1 Tri-Ply Oval Roasting Pan and Rack, $149.95, Cook’s Warehouse, cookswarehouse.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/09/dining/09BURNER-PAN/09BURNER-PAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/09/dining/09BURNER-PAN/09BURNER-PAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/09/dining/09BURNER-PAN/09BURNER-PAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/09/dining/09BURNER-PAN/09BURNER-PAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'a