in-cuban-ballet-defect-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of The International Herald Tribune: Ten ballet dancers from the Cuban National Ballet, including one of its stars, Eduardo Recal, defect and ask for political asylum in France while touring in Paris in November 1966.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Ten dancers skipped away from the Cuban National Ballet this weekend and asked for political asylum in France because of “the arbitrary persecution which has developed in our country.” It was the largest group of artists to defect here in recent years. It was also an embarrassing blow to the Havana government, which had given the successful company a proud sendoff when it left to open in the prestigious Fourth International Dance Festival last Wednesday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/07/blogs/07oldiht-1966-alonso/07oldiht-1966-alonso-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/07/blogs/07oldiht-1966-alonso/07oldiht-1966-alonso-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/07/blogs/07oldiht-1966-alonso/07oldiht-1966-alonso-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/07/blogs/07oldiht-1966-alonso/07oldiht-1966-alonso-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 291, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/07/blogs/07oldiht-1966-alonso/07oldiht-1966-alonso-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 291, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 