-making-shown-in-pictures/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of The International Herald Tribune: The Broadway Theatre shows the Paramount Pictograph’s motion picture, “A Newspaper in the Making,” filmed at the Herald Tribune building in New York, in November 1916.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the Broadway Theatre last night the spectators at the motion picture entertainment displayed a deep interest in “A Newspaper in the Making,” a part of the Paramount Pictograph, which was featured by itself. The remarkably close attention which the undramatic picture attracted seemed, judging by the comments of the spectators, to be caused by the clear exposition of a little understood and widely interesting subject — how the news gets from its happening onto the folded white pages of a newspaper.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/08/blogs/08oldiht-1916-herald/08oldiht-1916-herald-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/08/blogs/08oldiht-1916-herald/08oldiht-1916-herald-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 366}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/08/blogs/08oldiht-1916-herald/08oldiht-1916-herald-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 690, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/08/blogs/08oldiht-1916-herald/08oldiht-1916-herald-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 690, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/08/blogs/08oldiht-1916-herald/08oldiht-1916-herald-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail