urs, said tonight that the Beatles were not splitting up as a group. He noted that the foursome already has a movie commitment for next year. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/09/blogs/09oldiht-1966-beatles/09oldiht-1966-beatles-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/09/blogs/09oldiht-1966-beatles/09oldiht-1966-beatles-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 363}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/09/blogs/09oldiht-1966-beatles/09oldiht-1966-beatles-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 620, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/09/blogs/09oldiht-1966-beatles/09oldiht-1966-beatles-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1221, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/09/blogs/09oldiht-1966-beatles/09oldiht-1966-beatles-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/09/blogs/09oldiht-1966-beatles/09oldiht-1966-beatles-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/09/blogs/09oldiht-1966-beatles/09oldiht-1966-beatles-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1966: The Beatles May Never Tour Together Again', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 's