the S.E.C. will be a target for restrictions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/10/business/dealbook/how-trumps-presidency-will-change-the-justice-dept-and-sec.html', 'snippet': 'Leadership changes are expected, as well as a shift in the focus of prosecutors, and the S.E.C. will be a target for restrictions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The surprise election of Donald J. Trump as president raises questions about the changes he will make to the leadership of the Justice Department, including the possibility of a shift in the focus of prosecutors to different areas. Just as important, with Republicans still in control of Congress, there may be an opening to change the Securities and Exchange Commission’s enforcement program.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/business/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/10/business/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/business/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/business/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/business/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2/10DB-WHITECOLLAR2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/