 'nyt://article/356ee457-63c5-5fef-972b-c111810a6a1a'}, {'abstract': 'Many supporters said they hoped for great things under a Trump presidency — though many also said they had no idea what they were in for.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/10/us/politics/trump-voters.html', 'snippet': 'Many supporters said they hoped for great things under a Trump presidency — though many also said they had no idea what they were in for.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RALEIGH, N.C. — Coursing beneath the boisterous chanting of the president-elect’s name Tuesday night — that single syllable that will now forever conjure more than just a gilded real estate empire — were the more nuanced hopes, fears and expectations of the Americans who shocked the world, and even themselves, by electing Donald J. Trump president of the United States.', 'print_section': 'P', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10trumpvoices-1-sub/10trumpvoices-1-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10trumpvoices-1-sub/10trumpvoices-1-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10trumpvoices-1-sub/10trumpvoices-1-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10trumpvoices-1-sub/10trumpvoices-1-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10trumpvoices-1-sub/10trumpvoices-1-sub-thumbS