}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9652f30e-6747-5cfd-9655-7dc08d6da742', 'word_count': 422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9652f30e-6747-5cfd-9655-7dc08d6da742'}, {'abstract': 'Hillary Clinton’s defeat laid bare the Democratic Party’s weaknesses, and the party prepared for arguments over its future and mission.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/10/us/politics/their-leadership-lean-democrats-turn-an-eye-to-rebuilding.html', 'snippet': 'Hillary Clinton’s defeat laid bare the Democratic Party’s weaknesses, and the party prepared for arguments over its future and mission.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Hillary Clinton began her second bid for president, much of the Democratic Party rallied around her. Party leaders, campaign contributors and elected officials — including President Obama — sought to clear the field and ensure her an easy road to the White House.', 'print_section': 'P', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10dems2/10dems2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10dems2/10dems2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10dems2/10dems2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10dems2/10dems2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/us/10dems2/10dems2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 