'P', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Not Our President’: Protests Spread After Donald Trump’s Election', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Not Our President’: Protests Spread', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Correal, Annie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-10T02:13:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Mele and Annie Correal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mele', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Annie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Correal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f8166422-28f0-5376-93d3-8ce4f018238e', 'word_count': 827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f8166422-28f0-5376-93d3-8ce4f018238e'}, {'abstract': 'Millions of people who had once flocked to President Obama’s promise of hope and change saw in Mr. Trump their best chance to be heard and protected.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/10/us/politics/donald-trump-voters.html', 'snippet': 'Millions of people who had once flocked to President Obama’s promise of hope and change saw in Mr. Trump their best chance to be heard and protected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald J. Trump’s America flowered through the old union strongholds of the Midwest, along rivers and rail lines that once moved coal from southern Ohio and the hollows of West Virginia to the smelters of Pennsylvania.', 'pri