 the Lyons are back. They’re still fighting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/09/arts/television/empire-season-3-episode-5-recap.html', 'snippet': 'After a two-week hiatus, the Lyons are back. They’re still fighting.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Fighting is your family’s way of life,” Councilman Angelo Dubois tells Cookie Lyon. “It’s like it’s in your blood.” Normally a statement like this would be considered an insult. Angelo, however, means it as a heartfelt insight, if not an outright compliment. After witnessing the latest public throw-down involving Cookie’s kin, he’s become enlightened about her needs: He’s going to fight on her behalf just as ferociously as the members of her family fight among themselves.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/arts/2empire/2empire-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/02/arts/2empire/2empire-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/arts/2empire/2empire-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/arts/2empire/2empire-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/02/arts/2empire/2empire-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/arts/2empire/2empire-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/arts/2empire/2empire-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1417, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Empire’ Season 3, Episode 5: Fight Club', 'kicker': 'Empire', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Empire (TV Program)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-10T03:01:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sean T. Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sean', 'middlename': 'T.', 'lastname': 'Collins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/958d0298-0811-5dea-9c16-1a97fabb0f35', 'word_count': 1113, 'uri': 'nyt://article/958d0298-0811-5dea-9c16-1a97fabb0f35'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Cranshaw’s credits included classic recordings, late-night TV gigs, and even “Sesame Street.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/10/arts/music/bob-cranshaw-died-jazz-sonny-rollins.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cranshaw’s credits included classic recordings, late-night TV gigs, and even “Sesame Street.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bob Cranshaw, a versatile bassist heard in Broadway pit bands, on television and on thousands of jazz recordings — but probably best known as a longtime anchor in bands led by the eminent saxophonist Sonny Rollins — died on Nov. 2 at his home in Manhattan. He was 83.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/14/arts/10CRANSHAW-OBIT/10CRANSHAW-OBIT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 