ame': None, 'lastname': 'Hass', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d335667-3fac-548d-9263-3b56c89569d6', 'word_count': 128, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d335667-3fac-548d-9263-3b56c89569d6'}, {'abstract': 'Officers were responding to a domestic dispute in Canonsburg, just south of Pittsburgh, when they were “ambushed,” a state trooper said. A man and a woman were later found dead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/11/us/1-police-officer-dead-1-wounded-after-western-pennsylvania-shooting.html', 'snippet': 'Officers were responding to a domestic dispute in Canonsburg, just south of Pittsburgh, when they were “ambushed,” a state trooper said. A man and a woman were later found dead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One police officer was killed and another was wounded when they were “ambushed” while responding to a domestic dispute in western Pennsylvania, the authorities said on Thursday. Hours later, a man and a woman were found dead inside a home nearby.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11copshot_xp/11copshot_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11copshot_xp/11copshot_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11copshot_xp/11copshot_xp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11copshot_xp/11copshot_xp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'artic