representative from Illinois whose taste for first-class travel and a “Downton Abbey”-themed office design led to questions about his judgment and adherence to spending rules, was indicted on Thursday by a federal grand jury on 24 counts, including wire fraud and theft of government funds.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11schock_xp/11schock_xp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11schock_xp/11schock_xp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11schock_xp/11schock_xp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11schock_xp/11schock_xp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11schock_xp/11schock_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11schock_xp/11schock_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/us/11schock_xp/11schock_xp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Aaron Schock, Ex-Illinois Congressman, Is Indicted', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Illinois Ex-Lawmaker Indicted on 24 Counts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schock, Aaron', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Illinois', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-10T20:21:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9ec1bb3-7d55-555f-97b0-2974828a2395', 'word_count': 503, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9ec1bb3-7d55-555f-97b0-2974828a2395'}, {'abstract': 'The New York senator, the new minority leader, will need the conciliatory skills he has developed over the years, faced with Republican control of Congress and the White House.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/11/us/politics/chuck-schumer-senate-democrats.html', 'snippet': 'The New York senator, the new minority leader, will need the conciliatory skills he has developed over the years, faced with Republican control of Congress and the White House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In 2012, Senator Chuck Schumer, Democrat of New York, made an arresting offer to Senator Scott Brown, the Massachusetts Republican whose 2010 special-election victory had upended President Obama’s agenda. Help Democrats pass legislation to blunt the force of money in politics, he said, and they would not mount a serious challenge to Mr. Brown’s re-election.', 'print_section': 'P', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chuck Schumer Prepares for His Next Challenge: Leading Senate Democrats', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Schumer Is Set to Spar as Democrats’ Leader', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Charles E', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-10T20:24:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Steinhauer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Steinhauer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a019230-69a1-5358-88d9-a7d8d6147bcb', 'word_count': 1437, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a019230-69a1-5358-88d9-a7d8d6147bcb'}, {'abstract': 'Full of small and alluring independent boutiques, it’s a must-see for anyone who likes to shop at locally owned stores and experience the heart and charm of New York City.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/11/style/lower-east-side-effortlessly-cool.html', 'snippet': 'Full of small and alluring independent boutiques, it’s a must-see for anyone who likes to shop at locally owned stores and experience the heart and charm of New York City.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Start south of Delancey Street on Orchard and slowly make your way north. It’s easy to spend a full day here, as there are also numerous galleries. The Tenement Museum (103 Orchard Street) is also not to be missed. It offers excellent tours of the neighborhood that provide an even more immersive experience.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/style/11LOWEREASTWEB1/11LOWEREASTWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/11/style/11LOWEREASTWEB1/11LOWEREASTWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/style/11LOWEREASTWEB1/11LOWEREASTWEB1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/style/11LOWEREASTWEB1/11LOWEREASTWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/11/style/11LOWEREASTWEB1/11LOWEREASTWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/style/11LOWEREASTWEB1/11LOWEREASTWEB1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 596, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/style/11LOWEREASTWEB1/11LOWEREASTWEB1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1192, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lower East Side, Effortlessly Cool', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lower East Side, Effortlessly Cool', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lower East Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coffeehouses', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-10T20:25:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SpecialSections', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Xenia Rollinson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Xenia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rollinson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e178064-ca9c-570f-b2ec-c1b90d318ea8', 'word_count': 1137, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e178064-ca9c-570f-b2ec-c1b90d318ea8'}, {'abstract': 'While it’s a bit spread out, a vibrant retail scene includes dynamic stores popping up on blocks that are otherwise either residential or industrial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/11/style/clinton-hill-a-welcome-stroll.html', 'snippet': 'While it’s a bit spread out, a vibrant retail scene includes dynamic stores popping up on blocks that are otherwise either residential or industrial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joya Studio (19 Vanderbilt Avenue), near the Navy Yard, produces scented candles for more than 100 brands, from tastemaker designer labels to Nike. Since February, the front section of its manufacturing facility has been transformed into a boutique that’s evocative of a high-end art gallery, with hanging oak display cases backed with slabs of hot-rolled steel. (Periodically, the cases slide aside, making room for the delivery trucks that pull into the cavernous space.) Joya’s owner, Frederick Bouchardy, fills the store with personal picks, including the Claude Galien cologne his grandfather wore, Le Baigneur beard and face oil, thick leather coasters and a selection of art books.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/fashion/11CLINTONHILL1/11CLINTONHILL1-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/11/fashion/11CLINTONHILL1/11CLINTONHILL1-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/fashion/11CLINTONHILL1/11CLINTONHILL1-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/fashion/11CLINTONHILL1/11CLINTONHILL1-superJumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 1347, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/fashion/11CLINTONHILL1/11CLINTONHILL1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/11/fashion/11CLINTONHILL1/11CLINTONHILL1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/fashion/11CLINTONHILL1/11CLINTONHILL1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Clinton Hill, a Welcome Stroll', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clinton Hill, a Welcome Stroll', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, '