o at Bowie’s home in London. It’s one of several interviews collected in the recently published “David Bowie: The Last Interview and Other Conversations.” Bowie told Burroughs that his novel “Nova Express” “blew my head off,” noting similarities between it and his own futuristic creation, the concept-album character Ziggy Stardust: “Maybe we are the Rodgers and Hammerstein of the ’70s, Bill!”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/books/review/1113-BKS-OpenBook/1113-BKS-OpenBook-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 264, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/13/books/review/1113-BKS-OpenBook/1113-BKS-OpenBook-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 264}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/books/review/1113-BKS-OpenBook/1113-BKS-OpenBook-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 1019, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/books/review/1113-BKS-OpenBook/1113-BKS-OpenBook-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 1019, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/books/review/1113-BKS-OpenBook/1113-BKS-OpenBook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/13/books/review/1113-BKS-OpenBook/1113-BKS-OpenBook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/books/review/1113-BKS-OpenBook/1113-BKS-