a Hotel.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'November Nights', 'kicker': 'Party Coverage: Scene City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'November Nights', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Denny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aspen Institute', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Museum of Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Natural Resources Defense Council', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Memorial Sloan-Kettering Cancer Center', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-11T21:24:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denny Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/897a63db-d360-56b5-87d1-b8093aaeb480', 'word_count': 96, 'uri': 'nyt://article/897a63db-d360-56b5-87d1-b8093aaeb480'}, {'abstract': 'This eight-part documentary series looks at serial murders involving prostitutes, starting at Gilgo Beach on Long Island, but ranging far.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/12/arts/television/review-the-killing-season-examines-long-island-case.html', 'snippet': 'This eight-part documentary series looks at serial murders involving prostitutes, starting at Gilgo Beach on Long Island, but ranging far.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was only a matter of time before the television trend