: 'By Alissa J. Rubin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alissa', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Rubin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/991b8dae-8091-56fe-b236-00d2b02c2981', 'word_count': 1241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/991b8dae-8091-56fe-b236-00d2b02c2981'}, {'abstract': 'This is the story of the Paris attacks by those who lived through them. “I will always live with the fact that I saw ringing cellphones that said ‘Papa,’ ‘Maman,’ on the dead.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/13/world/europe/paris-one-year-on.html', 'snippet': 'This is the story of the Paris attacks by those who lived through them. “I will always live with the fact that I saw ringing cellphones that said ‘Papa,’ ‘Maman,’ on the dead.”', 'lead_paragraph': ' The night of Nov. 13, 2015, Islamic State militants attacked eight places in and around Paris, killing 130 people and wounding nearly 500. It was the most lethal attack in France since World War II. Confusion gripped the city as two teams of attackers struck nearly simultaneously. One struck at the Stade de France, just outside Paris, while the other shot up cafes and bars in the hip 10th and 11th Arrondissements. About 20 minutes later, a third team of attackers entered the Bataclan concert hall in the same neighborhood, taking hostages and killing scores.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/world/parisattacks-bataclan2/parisattacks-bataclan2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/10/world/parisattacks-bataclan2/parisattacks-bataclan2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/world/parisattacks-bataclan2/parisattacks-bataclan2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/world/parisattacks-bataclan2/parisattacks-bataclan2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/world/parisattacks-bataclan2/parisattacks-bataclan2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/10/world/parisattacks-bataclan2/parisattacks-bataclan2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/10/world/parisattacks-bataclan2/parisattacks-bataclan2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris: One Year On', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Attacks (November 2015)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bataclan (Paris, France)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eagles of Death Metal (Music Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Le Petit Cambodge (Paris, France, Restaurant)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': '11th Arrondissement (Paris, France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'La Belle Equipe (Paris, France, Restaurant)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value