y in domestic politics, geopolitics and the economy, the wealthy have been mindful of the potential downside of their investments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/13/your-money/the-wealthy-ask-themselves-what-do-we-have-to-lose.html', 'snippet': 'With the uncertainty in domestic politics, geopolitics and the economy, the wealthy have been mindful of the potential downside of their investments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even before Donald J. Trump defied the odds and was elected the 45th president of the United States, wealthy investors were feeling uneasy about the level of uncertainty in the global economy.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/your-money/13WEALTHSOVERSUB/13WEALTHSOVERSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 824, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/13/your-money/13WEALTHSOVERSUB/13WEALTHSOVERSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 824}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/your-money/13WEALTHSOVERSUB/13WEALTHSOVERSUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 747, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/your-money/13WEALTHSOVERSUB/13WEALTHSOVERSUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1493, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/your-money/13WEALTHSOVERSUB/13WEALTHSOVERSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/13/your-money/13WEALTHSOVERSUB/13WEALTHSOVERSUB-thumbStandard.j