nchor this past summer, I find myself lying awake at night thinking about my daughter — and your daughters, too. I’ve been asking myself this simple question: Will our girls finally be the ones to have workplaces free from sexual harassment? This question became even more compelling during the presidential race, where offensive comments about women were dismissed as “locker room talk.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/opinion/13carlson-photo/13carlson-photo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/13/opinion/13carlson-photo/13carlson-photo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/opinion/13carlson-photo/13carlson-photo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/opinion/13carlson-photo/13carlson-photo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/13/opinion/13carlson-photo/13carlson-photo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 660}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/opinion/13carlson-photo/13carlson-photo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 932, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/13/opinion/13carlson-photo/13carlson-photo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1630, 'width': 1482, 'subType': 'su