 that drew a Dubai entrepreneur to its watches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/15/fashion/watches-hublot-fashion-pirate.html', 'snippet': 'It was the brand’s social media profile that drew a Dubai entrepreneur to its watches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s no surprise that a blogger with 180,000 followers would be drawn to a watch by its social media profile.', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/fashion/15WEAR-INYT/15WEAR-INYT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/15/fashion/15WEAR-INYT/15WEAR-INYT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/fashion/15WEAR-INYT/15WEAR-INYT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/fashion/15WEAR-INYT/15WEAR-INYT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/fashion/15WEAR-INYT/15WEAR-INYT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/15/fashion/15WEAR-INYT/15WEAR-INYT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/fashion/15WEAR-INYT/15WEAR-INYT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Fashion Pirate