tility to the “establishment,” including big banks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/15/business/dealbook/trumps-presidency-raises-questions-on-the-future-of-wall-st-regulation.html', 'snippet': 'Answers are hard to come by, because the movement that elected Donald Trump is based in part on hostility to the “establishment,” including big banks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, I posed a provocative question on a financial services discussion board: If the expected overhaul of financial regulations proceeds, do we still need to worry about planning for the failure of big financial institutions, including derivatives clearinghouses?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/business/15DB-INDEBT/15DB-INDEBT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/15/business/15DB-INDEBT/15DB-INDEBT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/business/15DB-INDEBT/15DB-INDEBT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/business/15DB-INDEBT/15DB-INDEBT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1499, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/15/business/15DB-INDEBT/15DB-INDEBT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/15/business/15DB-INDEBT/15DB-INDEBT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge'