magazine/food/lexie-smith-lalo-restaurant-georgia-hilmer.html', 'snippet': 'The model and photographer Georgia Hilmer brings us into the kitchen of Lexie Smith, the head baker of the anticipated new restaurant Lalo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago, Georgia Hilmer, a photographer and model, and Lexie Smith, a baker and artist, parted with their then-boyfriends, who happened to live together. In the breakups’ aftermath, the girls became friends — “the best thing that came from those relationships,” Hilmer says, fiddling with her camera in Smith’s kitchen in Bushwick, Brooklyn.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/17/t-magazine/food/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/17/t-magazine/food/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/17/t-magazine/food/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/17/t-magazine/food/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/17/t-magazine/food/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI/17tmag-bread-first-slide-IZBI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url