ational relations as mayor of New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/16/nyregion/rudolph-giuliani-transition-secretary-of-state.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Giuliani, who aides to Donald J. Trump said was the leading contender to become secretary of state, practiced his own local form of international relations as mayor of New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In October 1995, the Palestinian leader Yasir Arafat settled into a seat at Lincoln Center in Manhattan for a gala performance of Beethoven’s Ninth Symphony. But before the third movement started, Mr. Arafat was told to leave.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/16/nyregion/16RUDYNYC1/16RUDYNYC1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/16/nyregion/16RUDYNYC1/16RUDYNYC1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/16/nyregion/16RUDYNYC1/16RUDYNYC1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/16/nyregion/16RUDYNYC1/16RUDYNYC1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/16/nyregion/16RUDYNYC1/16RUDYNYC1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/16/nyregion/16RUDYNYC1/16RUDYNYC1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': 