nt bank named Mr. Weinberg, whose family built a dynasty at Goldman, as its executive chairman.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/16/business/dealbook/john-weinberg-ex-goldman-executive-takes-a-top-post-at-evercore.html', 'snippet': 'The investment bank named Mr. Weinberg, whose family built a dynasty at Goldman, as its executive chairman.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Until last year, John S. Weinberg was a top corporate adviser at Goldman Sachs, a high-powered executive at the firm where his family built a banking dynasty.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'John Weinberg, Ex-Goldman Executive, Takes a Top Post at Evercore', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ex-Executive at Goldman  Takes a Seat at Evercore', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de la Merced, Michael J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Evercore Partners Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BlackRock Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weinberg, John S', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALTMAN, ROGER C', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-16T05:01:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://art