rgued. But it did change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/20/opinion/sunday/the-democrats-real-turnout-problem.html', 'snippet': 'Turnout did not plummet this year, as some argued. But it did change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Barack Obama’s two victories created the impression of a strong wind at the back of the Democratic Party. Its constituencies — the young, the nonwhite, the college educated — were not only growing but were also voting in increasing numbers. The age-old issue of voter turnout finally seemed to be helping the political left.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1290, 'width': 1289, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-thumbStandar