daptation of Liu Zhenyun’s novel of the same name, directed by Feng Xiaogang. But appreciating it, and the other points of interest in the movie, requires a perhaps unusual amount of patience, or even indulgence.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/18/arts/18IMNOTBOVARY/18IMNOTBOVARY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/18/arts/18IMNOTBOVARY/18IMNOTBOVARY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 650}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/18/arts/18IMNOTBOVARY/18IMNOTBOVARY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/18/arts/18IMNOTBOVARY/18IMNOTBOVARY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1891, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/18/arts/18IMNOTBOVARY/18IMNOTBOVARY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/18/arts/18IMNOTBOVARY/18IMNOTBOVARY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/18/arts/18IMNOTBOVARY/18IMNOTBOVARY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘I Am Not Madame Bovary’ Takes Man Trouble to New Levels', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo':