democracy is strong enough to weather whatever challenges may come its way?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/18/learning/how-strong-is-your-faith-in-american-democracy.html', 'snippet': 'Are you confident that the United States’s constitutional democracy is strong enough to weather whatever challenges may come its way?', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the second time in less than two decades, the United States elected a president who won the most electors to the Electoral College but lost the popular vote. Yet, Americans’ allegiance to the Constitution is so strong that in both cases, the winner of the popular vote conceded quickly and publicly so that the country could move forward with the peaceful transfer of power.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/17/world/17Potus1/17Potus1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/17/world/17Potus1/17Potus1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/17/world/17Potus1/17Potus1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/17/world/17Potus1/17Potus1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/17/world/17Potus1/17Potus1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/17/world/17Potus1/17Potus1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, 