Candidates have long promised to move the U.S. Embassy to Jerusalem, only to change course after being elected. Now Israel is waiting to see what President-elect Trump will do.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/19/world/middleeast/jerusalem-us-embassy-trump.html', 'snippet': 'Candidates have long promised to move the U.S. Embassy to Jerusalem, only to change course after being elected. Now Israel is waiting to see what President-elect Trump will do.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — America’s top diplomat in Jerusalem lives in an elegant three-story stone house first built by a German Lutheran missionary in 1868, a short walk from the historic Old City. But he is not an ambassador and the mission is a consulate, not an embassy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/19/world/19Jerusalem1/19Jerusalem1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/19/world/19Jerusalem1/19Jerusalem1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/19/world/19Jerusalem1/19Jerusalem1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/19/world/19Jerusalem1/19Jerusalem1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/19/world/19Jerusalem1/19Jerusalem1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/19/