king head emerges from the election as a popular voice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/20/fashion/van-jones-cnn-2016-presidential-election.html', 'snippet': 'The CNN talking head emerges from the election as a popular voice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Last Thursday, Van Jones couldn’t even buy a tuna wrap here without a woman in her late 20s walking up to him to ask for a selfie. Two minutes later, the Argentine woman behind the counter gave him a thumbs up.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/fashion/20JPVANJONES1/20JPVANJONES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 477, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/20/fashion/20JPVANJONES1/20JPVANJONES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 477}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/fashion/20JPVANJONES1/20JPVANJONES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/fashion/20JPVANJONES1/20JPVANJONES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1629, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/fashion/20JPVANJONES1/20JPVANJONES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/20/fashion/20JPVANJONES1/20JPVANJONES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/fashion/20JPVANJONES1/20JPVA