 three more towering figures have died. A look at their legacies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/19/arts/music/popcast-leonard-cohen-leon-russell-mose-allison.html', 'snippet': 'This year has seen the loss of Prince, David Bowie, Merle Haggard, and, now, three more towering figures have died. A look at their legacies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year, the world of pop music has been thick with mourning — Prince, David Bowie, Merle Haggard, and too many more. And just in the last couple of weeks, more deaths of towering figures: the melancholy poet Leonard Cohen, in the throes of a late-life creative surge; the revered songwriter and session player Leon Russell; and Mose Allison, a hybridizer of bebop and blues with a wicked streak in his lyrics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/12/arts/12COHENJP/12COHENJP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/12/arts/12COHENJP/12COHENJP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/12/arts/12COHENJP/12COHENJP-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/12/arts/12COHENJP/12COHENJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/12/arts/12COHENJP/12COHENJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/12/arts/12COHENJP/12COHENJP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'cro