': 868, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c59f0c4-94e7-5171-86b0-d6ffaaea84e4'}, {'abstract': 'He is likely to encourage President-elect Donald Trump’s worst impulses and fuel his suspicion of Muslims.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/19/opinion/michael-flynn-an-alarming-pick-for-national-security-adviser.html', 'snippet': 'He is likely to encourage President-elect Donald Trump’s worst impulses and fuel his suspicion of Muslims.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Of all the disturbing scenes in the presidential campaign, the Republican Convention speech by retired Lt. Gen. Michael Flynn stood out. During a fiery address in which he lamented the decline of American exceptionalism and lambasted the Democratic nominee, Hillary Clinton, General  Flynn joined the crowd in chants of “lock her up!” Smiling slyly, he shouted: “Yeah, that’s right, lock her up!”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/19/opinion/19sat2-flynn/19sat2-flynn-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/19/opinion/19sat2-flynn/19sat2-flynn-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/19/opinion/19sat2-flynn/19sat2-flynn-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/19/opinion/19sat2-flynn/19sat2-flynn-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 787, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/19/opinion/19sat2-flynn/19sat2-flynn-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 787}}, {'rank': 0, '