Saturday moved to mend fences with rivals, meeting with Mitt Romney to discuss naming him secretary of state.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/20/us/politics/donald-trump-mitt-romney-secretary-state.html', 'snippet': 'President-elect Donald J. Trump on Saturday moved to mend fences with rivals, meeting with Mitt Romney to discuss naming him secretary of state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEDMINSTER, N.J. — President-elect Donald J. Trump on Saturday moved to mend fences with political rivals after a divisive campaign, meeting with Mitt Romney, who had scathingly criticized him during the race as “a phony” and “a fraud,” to discuss naming him as secretary of state.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/us/20TRANSITION-SUB/20TRANSITION-SUB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/20/us/20TRANSITION-SUB/20TRANSITION-SUB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/us/20TRANSITION-SUB/20TRANSITION-SUB-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/us/20TRANSITION-SUB/20TRANSITION-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/20/us/20TRANSITION-SUB/20TRANSITION-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/20/us/20TRANSITION-SUB/20TRANSITION-SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width'