nday, November 20, 2016.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/20/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Sunday, November 20, 2016.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s a different environment now. I feel very upset and afraid for my friends. People are using the election as an excuse to discriminate against each other openly.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-11-20T01:53:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db7309c7-92f4-5283-8992-8b0160c33fe8', 'word_count': 47, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db7309c7-92f4-5283-8992-8b0160c33fe8'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Saturday, November 19, 2016.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/19/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Saturday, November 19, 2016.', 'lead_paragraph': '“American Muslims follow the U.S. Constitution. We call upon this incoming administration to also follow it.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-11-20T03:19:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/46a65152-9f58-5100-b269-60d9d41bb87c', 'word_count': 46, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46a65152-9f58-5100-b269-60d9d41bb87c'}, {'abstract