s', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3a7a6c2-4b4f-5ab3-af18-369851cdadc4', 'word_count': 1289, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3a7a6c2-4b4f-5ab3-af18-369851cdadc4'}, {'abstract': 'Matthew Abbott’s large-format photos of the outback have an eerie, bleak quality, with imperfections from dust and grime only adding to the mystery.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/11/21/bleak-mysteries-in-australias-outback/', 'snippet': 'Matthew Abbott’s large-format photos of the outback have an eerie, bleak quality, with imperfections from dust and grime only adding to the mystery.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s amazing how quickly the landscape changes, driving from Sydney and over the mountains,” Matthew Abbott, an Australian photographer, said. “Suddenly, it’s all dust and dryness.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bleak Mysteries in Australia’s Outback', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORIGINES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abbott, Matthew (Photographer)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Murray-Darling Basin (Australia)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sydney (Australia)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-21T09:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laurence Butet-Roch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laurence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Butet-Roch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/499e118c-8718-5ab2-80ca-76f0b78326cf', 'word_count': 845, 'uri': 'nyt://article/499e118c-8718-5ab2-80ca-76f0b78326cf'}, {'abstract': 'President Park Geun-hye’s problems have le