Street); $300 including dinner, $500 for premium seating ($1,000 after Dec. 7), 212-727-2737, irishrep.org.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/dining/23BURNER-PLAY/23BURNER-PLAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/23/dining/23BURNER-PLAY/23BURNER-PLAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/dining/23BURNER-PLAY/23BURNER-PLAY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/dining/23BURNER-PLAY/23BURNER-PLAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/23/dining/23BURNER-PLAY/23BURNER-PLAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/dining/23BURNER-PLAY/23BURNER-PLAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/dining/23BURNER-PLAY/23BURNER-PLAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dinner and James Joyce in New Adaptation of ‘The Dead’', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Participate: Playing the Part of Dinner Guest: You', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'nam