1e7a85de-719b-5f27-ac03-2c4af03cf759'}, {'abstract': 'The company, accused of scheming to deny the threat of climate change, has directed its fiercest return fire against the descendants of the company’s founder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/21/science/exxon-mobil-rockefellers-climate-change.html', 'snippet': 'The company, accused of scheming to deny the threat of climate change, has directed its fiercest return fire against the descendants of the company’s founder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Exxon Mobil, under fire over its past efforts to undercut climate science, is accusing the Rockefeller family of masterminding a conspiracy against it. Yes, that Rockefeller family.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/22/science/22ROCKEFELLERJP/22ROCKEFELLERJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/22/science/22ROCKEFELLERJP/22ROCKEFELLERJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/22/science/22ROCKEFELLERJP/22ROCKEFELLERJP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/22/science/22ROCKEFELLERJP/22ROCKEFELLERJP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/22/science/22ROCKEFELLERJP/22ROCKEFELLERJP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/22/science/22ROCKEFELL