7223044f59e6'}, {'abstract': 'It’s easy to envision the job of the federation’s president, Sunil Gulati, as akin to a professional general manager, but in reality the position has a much bigger scope.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/22/sports/soccer/sunil-gulati-us-soccer-jurgen-klinsmann.html', 'snippet': 'It’s easy to envision the job of the federation’s president, Sunil Gulati, as akin to a professional general manager, but in reality the position has a much bigger scope.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the end of a conference call on Tuesday during which he explained the decision to fire Jurgen Klinsmann as  coach of the United States men’s national team, Sunil Gulati, the president of U.S. Soccer, talked about the sport’s steep rise in popularity in this country. One result of that spike, Gulati said, is “that pressure has increased on anyone involved in the game.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/sports/23-Y-JP-GULATI/23-Y-JP-GULATI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/23/sports/23-Y-JP-GULATI/23-Y-JP-GULATI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/sports/23-Y-JP-GULATI/23-Y-JP-GULATI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/sports/23-Y-JP-GULATI/23-Y-JP-GULATI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/23/sports/23-Y-JP-GULATI/23-Y-JP-GULATI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, '