ich-a-death-separates-a-couple-and-connects-them.html', 'snippet': 'The loss of a young son is the central force in this work by the Dutch playwright Lot Vekemans.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Did you know I was writing a book?” the man asks his ex-wife, though this is maybe not the time to bring it up. Alone in a room at a cemetery, face to face for the first time in years, they are here about the grave of their little boy, Jacob. Evidently a toxin has seeped into the soil. Long in the ground, the body will have to be disinterred, then reburied in a less dangerous spot.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/arts/26POISON/26POISON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/23/arts/26POISON/26POISON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/arts/26POISON/26POISON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/arts/26POISON/26POISON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1071, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/arts/26POISON/26POISON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/23/arts/26POISON/26POISON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/23/arts/26POISON/26POISO