nd cooks dinner with his girlfriend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/23/nyregion/jon-batiste-sunday-routine.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Batiste gets up late, prays, meditates, looks at art, plays piano at his teacher’s home and cooks dinner with his girlfriend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Between leading impromptu street parades, performing as the bandleader on “The Late Show With Stephen Colbert” and fulfilling his duties as an artistic director of the National Jazz Museum in Harlem, Jon Batiste is busy enough. But this year, the Louisiana-born musician and composer also released his first holiday album, “Christmas With Jon Batiste,” a mix of original compositions and remixed classics. Mr. Batiste, 29, who lives alone in Midtown Manhattan, said Sundays offered him a “day of freedom and a time when I take a breather from rehearsals and performing.” SHIVANI VORA', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/27/nyregion/27ROUTINE3/27ROUTINE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/27/nyregion/27ROUTINE3/27ROUTINE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/27/nyregion/27ROUTINE3/27ROUTINE3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/27/nyregion/27ROUTINE3/27ROUTINE3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/27/nyregion/27ROUTINE3/27ROUTINE3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype