 'value': 'Kew Gardens (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Parks and Recreation Department (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fines (Penalties)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-11-24T18:52:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corey Kilgannon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Corey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kilgannon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39f9d7ce-ffad-5960-989b-226443a881df', 'word_count': 760, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39f9d7ce-ffad-5960-989b-226443a881df'}, {'abstract': 'The studio’s new animated movie did better on Wednesday, its first day of release, than Disney’s blockbuster did upon its debut in the same period in 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/24/movies/disneys-moana-surpasses-frozen-in-pre-thanksgiving-box-office.html', 'snippet': 'The studio’s new animated movie did better on Wednesday, its first day of release, than Disney’s blockbuster did upon its debut in the same period in 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Disney looks like it is beating itself going into this Thanksgiving weekend. The studio’s latest animated offering, “Moana,” about a defiant Polynesian princess on a heroine’s quest to save her people and restore the planet’s ecological balance, took in $15.6 million at the box office Wednesday, its first full day of release, running ahead of the studio’s smash hit “Frozen,” which drew $15.16 million on Thanksgiving Eve in 2013. While “Moana” is projected to earn more than $80 million over the five-day holiday weekend, that wouldn’t melt “Frozen,” which still holds the Thanksgiving five-day opening record, of $93.6 million. With runaway hits like “Finding Dory” and “Zootopia” under its belt, and “Rogue One: A Star Wars Story” looming, Disney is having a banner year. “Moana” is also holding a 97 percent fresh rating on the review-aggregation site Rotten Tomatoes, a hair behind “Zootopia,” at 98 percent.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/25/arts/25DISNEY-ITEM/25DISNEY-ITEM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/25/arts/25DISNEY-ITEM/25DISNEY-ITEM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/25/arts/25DISNEY-ITEM/25DISNEY-ITEM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/25/arts/25DISNEY-ITEM/25DISNEY-ITEM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/25/arts/25DISNEY-ITEM/25DISNEY-ITEM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/25/arts/25DISNEY-ITEM/25DISNEY-ITEM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/25/arts/25DISNEY-ITEM/25DISNEY-ITEM-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Disney’s ‘Moana’ Surpasses ‘Frozen’ in Pre-Thanksgiving Box Office', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Moana’ Passes ‘Frozen’ in Pre-Holiday Box Office', 'name': None, 'seo':