 drastically. He’s looked to the Michael Jackson 1980s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/28/arts/music/weeknd-starboy-mania-review.html', 'snippet': 'In the last two years, this singer has tempered his subject matter only slightly, but his sonic approach drastically. He’s looked to the Michael Jackson 1980s.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Attention,” which comes near the end of “Starboy,” the new album by the Weeknd, traverses one of his most familiar subjects: psychological antagonism pegged to sexual dominance. Or maybe it’s sexual antagonism pegged to psychological dominance. Either way. “Only thing left is the sex now,” he sings with what sounds like resignation until a couple of lines later, when he adds, “Only see me on the TV or the bed now.” He’s too busy to be sorry.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/29/arts/29WEEKND/29WEEKND-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/29/arts/29WEEKND/29WEEKND-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 686}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/29/arts/29WEEKND/29WEEKND-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 896, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/29/arts/29WEEKND/29WEEKND-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1999, 'width': 1748, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/29/arts/29WEEKND/29WEEKND-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/29/arts