 with federal officials, who say the signs are dangerous distractions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/30/nyregion/new-york-road-signs-feud.html', 'snippet': 'State road signs intended to generate love and money for New York have instead set off a feud with federal officials, who say the signs are dangerous distractions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The big blue signs — hundreds of them — crop up like crab grass along the highways and byways of New York State, enticing travelers to stop and take in the sights. The bright placards were dreamed up and placed there by the state to promote tourism, each brandishing New York’s cheerful and familiar credo: “I Love N.Y.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/nyregion/00NYSIGN/00NYSIGN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/30/nyregion/00NYSIGN/00NYSIGN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/nyregion/00NYSIGN/00NYSIGN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/nyregion/00NYSIGN/00NYSIGN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/30/nyregion/00NYSIGN/00NYSIGN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/nyregion/00NYSIGN/00NYSIGN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'r