s, audio recorders, social media and plain old notebooks, we hear the voices of a city in pain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Times Insider delivers behind-the-scenes insights into how news, features and opinion come together at The New York Times. In this article, Julie Bosman, a national correspondent covering the Midwest, and Catrin Einhorn, a reporter and editor based in Chicago, share how a Times team’s multifaceted reporting on one weekend in one city grew into a living, continuing memorial.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/24/insider/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/24/insider/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/24/insider/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/24/insider/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/24/insider/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/24/insider/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1/24-Insider-ChicagoMurder-Image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thum